+ *   - WM_SYSCOMMAND SC_CLOSE (X, Alt+F4, system menu, taskbar) asks the port (s_wm_close_ask, port/kz3/main.cpp opens
+ *     the game's exit dialog) and closes only when it declines; a bare WM_CLOSE (scripts, the dialog's Yes) and
+ *     WM_ENDSESSION close at once.
+ *   - placement: the windowed window is restored from display.ini at creation and saved on move/size end, on a
