+ *   - focus: WM_ACTIVATEAPP and minimise/restore go to s_wm_focus (the port's When unfocused setting).
+ *   - maximize (button, title-bar double-click: both arrive as SC_MAXIMIZE) in Windowed -> Borderless on that monitor;
+ *     Restore (SC_RESTORE while borderless and not minimised) and Alt+Enter go back to the saved window.
